# The build context is an allowlist: only what the Dockerfile copies is sent to
# the Docker daemon. Secrets (.env, cookies.txt), local media (data/), git
# history and build artifacts (_build, deps, cover, tmp, .elixir_ls, .expert)
# can never end up in the context or the image.
*

!mix.exs
!mix.lock
!config/
!lib/
!priv/
!assets/
!rel/

# Generated inside the image; stale local copies must not leak in.
priv/static/assets/
priv/static/cache_manifest.json
assets/node_modules/
**/.DS_Store
